title LLM agent with RAG
direction down
typeface mono
styleMode plain

User [icon: user]
Chat UI [icon: nextjs]

Agent runtime [icon: bot, color: violet] {
  Orchestrator [icon: workflow, description: plans and loops]
  Model [icon: claude, description: Claude]
  Guardrails [icon: shield, color: red]
  Memory [icon: redis, description: conversation state]
  Tools [color: blue] {
    Web search [icon: search]
    Code sandbox [icon: terminal]
    Ticketing [icon: linear]
    Calendar [icon: calendar]
  }
}
Retrieval [icon: layers, color: teal] {
  Embeddings [icon: sparkles]
  Vector store [icon: database, description: pgvector]
  Reranker [icon: list]
}
Knowledge sources [color: gray] {
  Docs site [icon: docs]
  Wiki [icon: notion]
  Support tickets [icon: invoice]
}
Ingestion pipeline [icon: pipeline]
Evals [icon: check, color: green]
Tracing [icon: activity]

User > Chat UI <> Orchestrator
Orchestrator <> Model
Orchestrator > Guardrails
Orchestrator <> Memory
Orchestrator > Web search, Code sandbox, Ticketing, Calendar
Orchestrator > Reranker: query
Reranker > Vector store
Docs site, Wiki, Support tickets > Ingestion pipeline > Embeddings > Vector store
Orchestrator --> Tracing
Tracing --> Evals
